  "title": "`auto` parameters",
  "summary": "A template with exactly one instantiation reveals the deduced type",
  "prose": "A second instantiation makes the deduction ambiguous and drops the hint, and a pack and the parameters after it never hint. A template body hints once across instantiations deducing the same type.",
